# Tablevera Merchant Mobile (`apps/merchant-mobile`)

Expo SDK 57 + React Native + Expo Router + Apollo Client + Zustand (MMKV) +
react-native-unistyles 3. Custom components only — no third-party UI libraries.
Icons are Lucide paths rendered with `react-native-svg`.

This is the **partner** client for Tablevera (restaurant_owner + manager day-of
ops). Package: `@reservations/merchant-mobile`. GraphQL is served by `apps/api`
at `/graphql`. Do not build platform `/admin/*` features here.

## Auth

- Allow only `restaurant_owner` and `manager` via `isPartnerMobileRole` from
  `@reservations/shared`. Reject diner and platform admin logins client-side.
- Auth tokens: `expo-secure-store` (`accessToken`, `refreshToken`)
- Password reset emails use `app: "dashboard"` (finish on Partner Hub)

## API

- Default: `EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL` or `http://localhost:4000/graphql`
- Prefer partner ops already used by `apps/dashboard` (`myRestaurants`,
  `myOwnerOverview`, `restaurantReservations`, `floorPlanOps`, waitlist,
  messages, notifications)

## Theme

- Root `unistyles.ts` — Forest & Gold light theme only
- Typography: **DM Sans only**
- Always use `theme.colors.*`, `theme.space(n)`, `theme.radius.*`

## Run (dev client required — not Expo Go)

```bash
pnpm install
pnpm --filter @reservations/merchant-mobile start
```
